<sect2 id="gimp-layer-flip-vertical">
  <title>Espelhar verticalmente</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Camada</primary>
    <secondary>Transformação</secondary>
    <tertiary>Espelhar verticalmente</tertiary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Espelhar verticalmente (camada)</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>
    The <guimenuitem>Flip Vertically</guimenuitem> command reverses the
    selected layers vertically, that is, from top to bottom.
  </para>
  <para>
    It leaves the dimensions of the layers and the pixel information unchanged.
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <para>
      You can access this command from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Layer</guimenu>
        <guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu>
        <guimenuitem>Flip Vertically</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>
  <sect3>
    <title>Exemplo</title>
    <figure>
      <title>Aplicando  <quote>Espelhar camada verticalmente</quote></title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata fileref="images/menus/layer/flip.png" format="PNG"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Antes de aplicar o comando</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata fileref="images/menus/layer/flip-v.png" format="PNG"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>A camada depois de ter sido espelhada. É como se a imagem fosse refletida ao longo do eixo <emphasis>horizontal</emphasis> central da camada.</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
